<title>SINGAPORE: NatSteel Broadway opens below IPO price.</title>
<headline>NatSteel Broadway opens below IPO price.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The share price of China-based NatSteel Broadway Ltd fell below its initial public offer price of US$0.70 on its first day of trading on the Stock Exchange of Singapore on Thursday.</p>
<p>The stock opened at US$0.635 and was trading around US$0.65 at 0215 GMT.</p>
<p>Including a block deal of 400,000 shares at $0.68, its total volume was 599,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company is an integrated contract manufacturer of plastic and metal components for electronics products.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
